---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Pricing — TotalRecalls" description="One-time $24 launch price. No subscription. No cloud locker.">

  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Pricing</h1>
  <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-4">TotalRecalls is a small Windows app that saves your ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, and Grok conversations into a private folder on your computer — readable Markdown + JSON you keep forever.</p>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">No subscription. No cloud locker. No account required.</p>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-12 rounded-lg mb-12">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Launch Price</h2>
      <div class="text-4xl font-semibold mb-3">$24</div>
      <div class="text-gray-600 mb-6">One-time purchase · Windows app · Local files only</div>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Pay once with Lemon Squeezy. Download the Windows app. Export your AI conversations locally, on your PC.</p>
      <a href="/buy/" class="block w-full bg-black text-white text-center py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-800">Buy TotalRecalls — $24</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">What You Get</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
      <li>Export from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini (Takeout), Grok</li>
      <li>Local Markdown + JSON files</li>
      <li>Private folder structure you own</li>
      <li>No cloud storage</li>
      <li>No telemetry</li>
      <li>No recurring fees</li>
      <li>Free minor updates during the launch period</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Why One-Time Pricing?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">TotalRecalls is a utility, not a subscription service. You pay once, download the app, and keep your archive forever.</p>
    <p class="text-gray-700">Later, when advanced features arrive (semantic search, Obsidian/Notion sync, RAG containers, multi-device memory), those will be <strong>optional upgrades</strong> — not required for basic exporting.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Why $24?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">The original price is $49, but early adopters get a launch discount:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4">
      <li>To reduce friction</li>
      <li>To gather feedback</li>
      <li>To build the first user base</li>
      <li>To reward early supporters</li>
      <li>To accelerate development of new features</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>The price will return to $49</strong> after the launch window.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Simple Commercial Deal</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
      <li>One payment</li>
      <li>No monthly "AI archive" subscription</li>
      <li>No seat tax</li>
      <li>No upsells</li>
      <li>No hidden fees</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-gray-700">Just a Windows app that saves your AI conversations into files you own.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 py-12 rounded-lg text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-100">Ready to own your AI conversations?</h2>
    <div class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-2">$24</div>
    <div class="text-gray-400 mb-6">launch price</div>
    <a href="/buy/" class="inline-block bg-white text-gray-900 py-3 px-6 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-200">Buy TotalRecalls — $24</a>
    <p class="mt-4"><a href="/download/" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-gray-100">Already purchased? Download ZIP</a></p>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
